<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Fritz Cos cut to neutral.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Fritz Cos cut to neutral.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Alex. Brown &amp; Sons said on Tuesday it had reduced its rating for Fritz Cos Inc to neutral from buy.</p>
<p>-- The company's shares fell 3/4 to 14-1/4 in early trade.</p>
<p>-- Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1730</p>
</text>
